{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cDark times have come, and the horror nurtured by our fears is already at the doorstep.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unprecedented trials have descended upon this place, and only you can neutralize the threat.<br>Explore this godforsaken land, find new items to help you survive, and do not let the corruption seep into your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The local legend says: \u201cOnly the vigilant will behold the dawn, while the drowsy will see nothing but eternal darkness!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you capable of enduring the night in this harsh land?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your supplies wisely! The night spares no one.<br>Explore the surroundings and find the items you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.poster.avif?t=1765290031\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.webm?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.mp4?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of this place and save it\u2014or at least save yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The region hides many secrets and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/9f9cabc26e17ef02b996c99f2b90452a.poster.avif?t=1765290031\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/9f9cabc26e17ef02b996c99f2b90452a.webm?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/9f9cabc26e17ef02b996c99f2b90452a.mp4?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a squirrel, a special agent of Offisium Securitatis Internae, the \u201cDirectorate of Internal Security.\u201d She must not only understand and eliminate the source of the threat, but also survive. The help of the local inhabitants will clearly be indispensable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/629b2a3b2d25cc353e2fa4837d376d4b.poster.avif?t=1765290031\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/629b2a3b2d25cc353e2fa4837d376d4b.webm?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/629b2a3b2d25cc353e2fa4837d376d4b.mp4?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What secrets does this place hold?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, players will feel the inevitable horror drawing closer. Each new dawn brings something new: unavoidable global events, characters disappearing, mysterious monsters appearing. And above all, the approach of the final sunset, unless the source of the threat is found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/faea540c04b46f9823a5dec55a11a84f.poster.avif?t=1765290031\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/faea540c04b46f9823a5dec55a11a84f.webm?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/faea540c04b46f9823a5dec55a11a84f.mp4?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And remember: time is against you. What will the next morning bring?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127340?t=1765290031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127340?t=1765290031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/3d6a1364f732e1c4f9181c2f715526a5246fb64c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765290031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/3d6a1364f732e1c4f9181c2f715526a5246fb64c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765290031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent depictions of violence, including blood, physical injury, corpses and murder. There are scenes that show or strongly imply suicide/self-harm. The overall atmosphere is dark, tense and unsettling, although clearly fictional and stylized. \r\n\r\nThe game also includes mild to moderate profanity in character dialogue.\r\n\r\nThe game does not depict sexual assault, non-consensual sex or BDSM, and it does not focus on drug or alcohol abuse. Some players may find the themes and imagery disturbing. Player discretion is strongly advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cDark times have come, and the horror nurtured by our fears is already at the doorstep.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unprecedented trials have descended upon this place, and only you can neutralize the threat.<br>Explore this godforsaken land, find new items to help you survive, and do not let the corruption seep into your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The local legend says: \u201cOnly the vigilant will behold the dawn, while the drowsy will see nothing but eternal darkness!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you capable of enduring the night in this harsh land?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your supplies wisely! The night spares no one.<br>Explore the surroundings and find the items you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.poster.avif?t=1765290031\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.webm?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.mp4?t=1765290031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of this place and save it\u2014or at least save yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The region hides many secrets and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/9f9cabc26e17ef02b996c99f2b90452a